        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this superb three-bedroom, three-bathroom duplex apartment to the market ideally situated in the ever-popular Chipping Terrace development, Ongar, Dublin 15.\nChipping Terrace is a mature and highly sought-after development located in the heart of Ongar, offering a fantastic range of local amenities within walking distance including schools, shops, cafés, restaurants and recreational facilities. Blanchardstown Shopping Centre is just a short drive away, while commuters are well catered for with excellent public transport links and easy access to the M50, N3 and Dublin City Centre.\nBright, spacious and well-proportioned internal living accommodation extending to approximately c. 110 sq.m briefly comprises an entrance hallway, a generous living room, a fully fitted kitchen/dining area and a guest WC. Upstairs hosts three well-appointed bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, together with a modern family bathroom. Externally, the property benefits from a private, low-maintenance balcony terrace, providing the perfect space for outdoor dining and relaxation. The property also benefits from designated parking for added convenience.\nNo. 8 comes to the market in excellent condition throughout and boasts a host of additional features including a B BER rating eligible for a GREEN mortgage, newly fitted carpets and spacious accommodation spread over two levels. Offered to the market with no onward chain, this fantastic home is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, growing families, investors and those looking to upsize. Early viewing is strongly advised. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to register your interest and arrange a viewing.\n\nFeatures\n• 3 bed / 3 bath duplex apartment\n• C. 110 sq.m\n• B BER rating for excellent energy efficiency\n• Turnkey condition throughout\n• Newly fitted carpets\n• Private low-maintenance balcony terrace\n• Designated parking\n• Spacious accommodation over two levels\n• No onward chain\n• Highly sought-after development\n• Close to schools, shops and local amenities\n• Excellent public transport links\n• Easy access to the M50 & N3 road networks\n• Blanchardstown Shopping Centre within minutes\n• Ideal for first-time buyers, growing families and investors\n• Early viewing strongly advised"
      },
      {
